          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2^2\\times2^3\\times2^2}{2^7\\times2^3}&=\\frac{2^7}{2^{10}} \\\\ &=\\frac1{2^3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
